@startuml usecase
title Colors Web Application - Use Case Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "User" as User
actor "MySQL Database" as DB <<system>>

note top of User
  Accounts are created manually in MySQL.
  The app has no registration page.
end note

rectangle "Colors Web Application" {
  usecase "Log In" as UC_Login
  usecase "Add Color" as UC_Add
  usecase "Search Colors" as UC_Search
  usecase "Log Out" as UC_Logout
  usecase "Validate Session\n(read userId cookie)" as UC_Session
}

User --> UC_Login
User --> UC_Add
User --> UC_Search
User --> UC_Logout

UC_Add ..> UC_Session : <<include>>
UC_Search ..> UC_Session : <<include>>

UC_Login --> DB
UC_Add --> DB
UC_Search --> DB

note right of UC_Session
  color.html calls readCookie() on load.
  If no userId is found, the user is
  redirected to index.html.
end note

note right of UC_Search
  Returns only colors whose Name
  contains the search text and whose
  UserID matches the logged-in user.
end note

@enduml
